RT-DETRv3 PyTorch

This distribution contains source code adapted from the following
Apache-2.0-licensed projects:

- RT-DETRv3, https://github.com/clxia12/RT-DETRv3,
  revision 349e7d99a5065e7b684118912e6a74178d4f4625.
- PaddleDetection, https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleDetection.

Copyright and attribution notices from those projects are retained in the
individual source files. The official and converted model checkpoints are not
included in the Python wheel or source distribution. Their provenance,
checksums, and release-candidate paths are recorded in
configs/checkpoints/rtdetrv3_coco.yml.
